msgid "## Speculating using DFlash"
msgstr "## 使用DFlash进行推测解码"

msgid ""
"The following code configures vLLM Ascend to use speculative decoding where "
"proposals are generated by a DFlash block diffusion-based parallel draft "
"model."
msgstr "以下代码配置vLLM Ascend使用推测解码，其中提案由基于DFlash块扩散的并行草稿模型生成。"

msgid "## Speculating using DSpark"
msgstr "## 使用DSpark进行推测解码"

msgid ""
"The following code configures vLLM Ascend to use speculative decoding where "
"proposals are generated by a DSpark semi-autoregressive block drafter with a"
" sequential Markov logit-bias head."
msgstr "以下代码配置vLLM Ascend使用推测解码，其中提案由带有顺序马尔可夫对数偏置头的DSpark半自回归块草稿器生成。"

msgid ""
"For improved performance, it is recommended to use a RAM-mounted file system"
" such as `/dev/shm/` for online usage in which the client cleans up the "
"files soon after they are generated."
msgstr "为提升性能，建议在线使用时使用挂载于RAM的文件系统（如`/dev/shm/`），以便客户端在文件生成后立即清理。"

msgid ""
"The `extract_hidden_states` method is a special speculative decoding mode "
"that does not perform actual speculation. Instead, it extracts hidden states"
" from specified layers of the target model and saves them to disk. This is "
"primarily used for collecting training data for EAGLE-style draft models. "
"The dumps are then used to train EAGLE/EAGLE-3 drafts."
msgstr ""
"`extract_hidden_states` "
"方法是一种特殊的投机解码模式，它不执行实际的推测，而是从目标模型的指定层中提取隐藏状态并保存到磁盘。这主要用于为 EAGLE "
"风格的草稿模型收集训练数据。随后这些转储数据被用于训练 EAGLE/EAGLE-3 草稿模型。"

msgid "### Adaptive verification"
msgstr "### 自适应验证"

msgid ""
"Adaptive verification lets DSpark choose how many draft tokens to verify for\n"
"each request at every decode step. Requests with higher confidence can keep a\n"
"longer draft, while low-confidence drafts are shortened to avoid unnecessary\n"
"target-model computation. It is disabled by default and requires a DSpark\n"
"model with a confidence head."
msgstr ""
"自适应验证允许 DSpark 在每个解码步骤中为每个请求选择要验证的草稿 token "
"数量。置信度较高的请求可以保留较长的草稿，而置信度较低的草稿则会被缩短，以避免不必要的目标模型计算。该功能默认禁用，并且需要带有置信度头的 DSpark"
" 模型。"

msgid "Enable it in `speculative_config`:"
msgstr "在 `speculative_config` 中启用它："

msgid ""
"> **Performance note (Ascend):** The benefits of adaptive verification depend on\n"
"> the workload.\n"
">\n"
"> - **In low-latency scenarios**, enabling adaptive verification may degrade performance.\n"
">\n"
"> - **In high-throughput scenarios (host)**, performance may degrade when the proxy or API server is the bottleneck.\n"
">\n"
"> - **In high-throughput scenarios (device)**, workloads with very high draft token acceptance rates may see no\n"
">   additional benefit.\n"
">\n"
"> **Performance troubleshooting (Ascend):**\n"
">\n"
"> - **In high-throughput scenarios**, performance gains from adaptive verification may sometimes fall short of expectations.\n"
">   In such cases, start by investigating the cause at the actual serving concurrency."
msgstr ""
"> **性能提示（昇腾）：** 自适应验证的收益取决于实际负载。\n"
">\n"
"> - **在低时延场景中**，开启自适应验证可能导致性能劣化。\n"
">\n"
"> - **在高吞吐场景中（host）**，当性能受限于 proxy / API server 时，也可能出现性能劣化。\n"
">\n"
"> - **在高吞吐场景中（device）**，草稿 token 接受率很高时，也可能无法获得额外收益。\n"
">\n"
"> **性能定位（昇腾）：**\n"
">\n"
"> - **在高吞吐场景下**，自适应验证的性能提升有时会不及预期。此时，请优先结合实际并发数定位原因。"

msgid ""
"For more details, see the\n"
"[vLLM community documentation](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/speculative_decoding/adaptive_verification/)."
msgstr ""
"更多详细信息，请参阅\n"
"[vLLM 社区文档](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/speculative_decoding/adaptive_verification/)。"

msgid "## Speculating using DFlash2"
msgstr "## 使用 DFlash2 进行推测解码"

msgid ""
"The following code configures vLLM Ascend to use speculative decoding where\n"
"proposals are generated by a **DFlash2** draft model. DFlash2 keeps DFlash's\n"
"parallel block-drafting input layout, but instead of taking the per-position\n"
"argmax token, the draft proposes a top-k candidate set for every draft\n"
"position and a candidate-selector head walks the highest-scoring path through\n"
"the candidate lattice."
msgstr ""
"以下代码配置 vLLM Ascend 使用推测解码，其中候选 token 由 **DFlash2** 草稿模型生成。DFlash2 保留了 DFlash"
" 的并行块草稿输入布局，但不再取每个位置的 argmax token，而是为每个草稿位置提出一个 top-k "
"候选集，并由候选选择器头在候选格中走出得分最高的路径。"

msgid ""
"There is no separate `dflash2` method value: keep `\"method\": \"dflash\"` — when\n"
"the draft checkpoint's architecture is `DFlash2DraftModel` (e.g.\n"
"`z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2`), the DFlash2 drafter is selected automatically."
msgstr ""
"没有单独的 `dflash2` 方法值：请保持 `\"method\": \"dflash\"` —— 当草稿检查点的架构为 "
"`DFlash2DraftModel`（例如 `z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2`）时，会自动选择 DFlash2 草稿模型。"

msgid "### How it works"
msgstr "### 工作原理"

msgid ""
"Each decode step drafts one block of `num_speculative_tokens` tokens in\n"
"parallel, exactly like DFlash: one bonus query (the last verified token,\n"
"the *anchor*) followed by K masked queries."
msgstr ""
"每个解码步骤并行草拟一个包含 `num_speculative_tokens` 个 token 的块，与 DFlash 完全一致：一个 bonus "
"查询（最后一个已验证的 token，即*锚点*）后跟 K 个掩码查询。"

msgid "A few important things to consider when using DFlash2 draft models:"
msgstr "使用 DFlash2 草稿模型时需要注意以下几点："

msgid ""
"4. **The draft must use the target's unquantized LM head**: the candidate\n"
"   top-k is taken over the full-vocabulary logits, so a reduced draft\n"
"   vocabulary is not supported."
msgstr ""
"4. **草稿必须使用目标模型未量化的 LM head**：候选\n"
"   top-k 是在全词表 logits 上取得的，因此不支持缩减的草稿\n"
"   词表。"

msgid ""
"5. The selector parameters (`selector_top_k`, `selector_rank`, ...) come from\n"
"   the draft checkpoint's `dflash_config` and need no user configuration."
msgstr ""
"5. 选择器参数（`selector_top_k`、`selector_rank` 等）来自\n"
"   草稿检查点的 `dflash_config`，无需用户配置。"

msgid ""
"On Ascend NPUs, the `npu_fused_infer_attention_score` operator supports a "
"maximum of 16 tokens per decode round. Therefore, `(num_speculative_tokens +"
" 1)` must be ≤ 16."
msgstr ""
"在昇腾 NPU 上，`npu_fused_infer_attention_score` 算子每轮解码最多支持 16 个 "
"token。因此，`(num_speculative_tokens + 1)` 必须 ≤ 16。"

msgid ""
"Due to the fact that only a single layer of weights is exposed in DeepSeek's"
" MTP, accuracy and performance are not effectively guaranteed in scenarios "
"where `num_speculative_tokens > 1` (especially ≥ 3)."
msgstr ""
"由于 DeepSeek 的 MTP 仅暴露单层权重，在 `num_speculative_tokens > 1`（尤其是 ≥ "
"3）的场景下，精度和性能无法得到有效保证。"

msgid ""
"In the fullgraph mode with `num_speculative_tokens > 1`, the capture size of"
" each ACLGraph must be an integer multiple of `(num_speculative_tokens + "
"1)`."
msgstr ""
"在 `num_speculative_tokens > 1` 的 fullgraph 模式下，每个 ACLGraph 的捕获大小必须是 "
"`(num_speculative_tokens + 1)` 的整数倍。"

msgid ""
"This method produces only 1 output token per request. The primary output is "
"the hidden states saved to disk, not the generated text."
msgstr "该方法每次请求仅产生 1 个输出 token。主要输出是保存到磁盘的隐藏状态，而非生成的文本。"

msgid ""
"Synthetic mode accepts draft tokens regardless of whether they match the "
"target distribution, so the generated output is **not semantically "
"correct**. Use it for benchmarking and validation only, **never for "
"production serving**."
msgstr ""
"Synthetic 模式无论草稿 token "
"是否匹配目标分布都会接受它们，因此生成的输出**在语义上不正确**。仅将其用于基准测试和验证，**切勿用于生产服务**。"

msgid ""
"Block verification supports both greedy and probabilistic draft sampling. "
"Target requests with `temperature=0` retain greedy verification behavior. It"
" cannot be combined with synthetic rejection sampling; do not set "
"`synthetic_acceptance_rates` or `synthetic_acceptance_length` when using "
"`\"block\"`."
msgstr ""
"块验证同时支持贪心和概率草稿采样。`temperature=0` 的目标请求保持贪心验证行为。它不能与合成拒绝采样结合使用；使用 `\"block\"`"
" 时不要设置 `synthetic_acceptance_rates` 或 `synthetic_acceptance_length`。"

msgid "## Experimental GLM KDA RecoverSSM"
msgstr "## 实验性 GLM KDA RecoverSSM"

msgid ""
"Enable this path with upstream vLLM's `--use-replayssm` option, which defaults\n"
"to disabled. See the [vLLM serving CLI reference](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/cli/serve/)\n"
"and [CacheConfig API reference](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/api/vllm/config/cache/)\n"
"for the upstream option. Upstream describes Mamba2 ReplaySSM under this flag;\n"
"the GLM KDA behavior and requirements in this section are provided by the\n"
"Ascend integration."
msgstr ""
"使用上游 vLLM 的 `--use-replayssm` 选项启用此路径，该选项默认禁用。关于该上游选项，请参阅 [vLLM serving CLI "
"参考](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/cli/serve/) 和 [CacheConfig API "
"参考](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/api/vllm/config/cache/)。上游在该标志下描述的是 "
"Mamba2 ReplaySSM；本节中 GLM KDA 的行为和要求由昇腾集成提供。"

msgid ""
"Add the following options to your GLM serving command. Keep the parallelism,\n"
"quantization, KV-cache dtype, and memory settings appropriate for your model\n"
"and devices:"
msgstr "将以下选项添加到你的 GLM 服务命令中。请保留适合你的模型和设备的并行度、量化、KV 缓存数据类型和内存设置："

msgid ""
"This feature is experimental. Floating-point differences can change generated\n"
"    tokens; evaluate model accuracy and performance for your workload before use."
msgstr "此功能为实验性功能。浮点差异可能会改变生成的 token；使用前请针对你的工作负载评估模型精度和性能。"

msgid "Removing `--use-replayssm` selects the native KDA path."
msgstr "移除 `--use-replayssm` 将选择原生 KDA 路径。"

msgid ""
"3. **Graph capture sizes**: each decode step runs `(1 + K)` tokens per\n"
"   request, so every capture size must be `n * (num_speculative_tokens + 1)`\n"
"   for each batch size `n` you want to support — `[9]` above, for batch size\n"
"   1 with `num_speculative_tokens = 8`.\n"
"   For `num_speculative_tokens` of 4, 5, or 6, use multiples of 5, 6, or 7,\n"
"   respectively. Choose a draft length supported by the checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"3. **图捕获尺寸**：每个解码步骤对每个请求运行 `(1 + K)` 个 token，因此对于每个要支持的批大小 `n`，每个捕获尺寸必须为 `n * (num_speculative_tokens + 1)` —— 上例中的 `[9]` 对应批大小为 1、`num_speculative_tokens = 8` 的情况。\n"
"   当 `num_speculative_tokens` 为 4、5 或 6 时，请分别使用 5、6 或 7 的倍数。请选择 checkpoint 支持的草稿长度。"

msgid "## Speculating using LiLiCorr"
msgstr "## 使用 LiLiCorr 进行投机推理"

msgid ""
"LiLiCorr is a DFlash variant that reranks the per-position top-k candidate\n"
"lattice before target-model verification. It requires a dedicated\n"
"`LiLiCorrDraftModel` checkpoint trained for the target model; a regular DFlash\n"
"or DFlash2 checkpoint cannot be substituted. The configured\n"
"`num_speculative_tokens` should equal the checkpoint's trained block size minus\n"
"one (the example below assumes a block size of eight). Shorter lengths down to\n"
"one token are supported, but may reduce acceptance; measure them with your\n"
"checkpoint and workload. Longer lengths are unsupported."
msgstr ""
"LiLiCorr 是 DFlash 的一种变体，它在目标模型验证之前对每个位置的 top-k 候选格进行重排序。它需要为目标模型专门训练的 "
"`LiLiCorrDraftModel` checkpoint；普通的 DFlash 或 DFlash2 checkpoint 无法替代。配置的 "
"`num_speculative_tokens` 应等于 checkpoint 训练时的块大小减一（下面的示例假设块大小为八）。支持短至一个 token"
" 的更短长度，但可能会降低接受率；请使用你的 checkpoint 和工作负载进行测量。不支持更长的长度。"

msgid ""
"Both the plain and convolutional LiLiCorr checkpoint variants are supported.\n"
"The real-weight CI test pairs `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B` with the ModelScope draft\n"
"`niannianxu/Qwen3.8-27B-LiLiCorr-block8-epoch0`, using TP=2 and seven\n"
"speculative tokens. Both models are listed in the A2/A3 download catalog.\n"
"After the CI model-download job has populated the cache, run:"
msgstr ""
"同时支持普通版和卷积版 LiLiCorr checkpoint 变体。真实权重 CI 测试将 `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B` 与 "
"ModelScope 草稿模型 `niannianxu/Qwen3.8-27B-LiLiCorr-block8-epoch0` 配对，使用 TP=2 "
"和七个投机 token。两个模型均列在 A2/A3 下载目录中。在 CI 模型下载任务填充缓存后，运行："

msgid ""
"The test compares greedy output token IDs with target-only decoding for both\n"
"draft sampling modes, exercises nonzero-temperature probabilistic drafting,\n"
"and checks draft/acceptance metric consistency. Acceptance length is recorded\n"
"for calibration; no unmeasured throughput or acceptance-rate threshold is set."
msgstr ""
"该测试针对两种草稿采样模式，将贪心输出 token ID "
"与仅目标模型解码的结果进行比较，测试非零温度的概率草稿采样，并检查草稿/接受指标的一致性。接受长度会被记录用于校准；未设置任何未经测量的吞吐量或接受率阈值。"

msgid ""
"Standard tensor parallelism is supported. Fine-grained embedding/LM head TP\n"
"and PCP vocabulary weight sharding are currently unsupported; the candidate\n"
"path requires the standard TP vocabulary layout.\n"
"Use the checkpoint's own `dflash_config` values for candidate top-k and\n"
"convolution geometry; these values are part of the trained model and should\n"
"not be tuned at serving time."
msgstr ""
"支持标准张量并行。目前不支持细粒度的 embedding/LM head TP 和 PCP 词表权重分片；候选路径需要标准的 TP 词表布局。\n"
"候选 top-k 和卷积几何参数请使用 checkpoint 自带的 `dflash_config` 值；这些值是训练模型的一部分，不应在服务时进行调整。"

msgid ""
"Both `draft_sample_method: \"greedy\"` and `\"probabilistic\"` use the correlator's\n"
"conditional scores. Probabilistic drafting supplies the realized proposal\n"
"distribution to the rejection sampler and uses a separate random stream from\n"
"target sampling. Compare acceptance length and throughput for both modes with\n"
"your workload. Quantized draft projections require a quantization format\n"
"supported by Ascend; NVIDIA ModelOpt NVFP4 exports are not portable merely\n"
"because the upstream LiLiCorr loader accepts them."
msgstr ""
"`draft_sample_method: \"greedy\"` 和 `\"probabilistic\"` "
"都使用相关器的条件分数。概率草稿采样将实际实现的提议分布提供给拒绝采样器，并使用与目标采样不同的随机流。请针对你的工作负载比较两种模式的接受长度和吞吐量。量化草稿投影需要昇腾支持的量化格式；NVIDIA"
" ModelOpt NVFP4 导出并不能仅仅因为上游 LiLiCorr 加载器接受它们就具备可移植性。"

msgid ""
"For a latency comparison on NPU, use real checkpoint weights and run the same\n"
"batch and sequence lengths without speculative decoding, with greedy drafts,\n"
"and with probabilistic drafts. For example:"
msgstr ""
"要在 NPU 上比较延迟，请使用真实 checkpoint "
"权重，并在不使用投机解码、使用贪心草稿以及使用概率草稿三种情况下运行相同的批大小和序列长度。例如："

msgid ""
"Repeat at the production batch sizes and context lengths, keeping TP size,\n"
"target execution mode, and prefix caching settings fixed. Measure acceptance\n"
"length and serving throughput alongside latency; synthetic prompts alone do\n"
"not establish the production speedup."
msgstr ""
"在生产批大小和上下文长度下重复测试，保持 TP "
"大小、目标执行模式和前缀缓存设置不变。在测量延迟的同时，还要测量接受长度和服务吞吐量；仅凭合成提示词无法证明生产环境的加速效果。"

msgid ""
"For GQA draft heads of size 192, the backend zero-pads Q/K/V to 256 for the CANN\n"
"kernel, keeps the original attention scale, and trims the output back to 192.\n"
"Model weights and logical head sizes are unchanged. These draft KV cache pages\n"
"use one third more storage than unpadded 192-wide pages, and padding adds work;\n"
"this backend does not guarantee higher speculative acceptance rates."
msgstr ""
"对于大小为 192 的 GQA 草稿头，该后端会将 Q/K/V 零填充到 256 以适配 CANN 内核，保持原始注意力缩放，并将输出裁剪回 "
"192。模型权重和逻辑头大小保持不变。这些草稿 KV 缓存页比未填充的 192 "
"宽页多使用三分之一的存储空间，且填充会增加额外工作；该后端不保证更高的投机接受率。"

msgid ""
"FlashMLA currently requires local Q heads and `local Q heads * DCP size` in\n"
"`{8, 12, 64, 96}`, with latent/RoPE dimensions of 512/64. The 64-head GLM draft\n"
"therefore uses FIA at TP2/TP4. KV NZ and PCP are unsupported. When the target\n"
"KV cache is FP8, set `\"kv_cache_dtype\": \"bfloat16\"` in `--speculative-config`\n"
"for a BF16 draft."
msgstr ""
"FlashMLA 目前要求本地 Q 头数以及 `本地 Q 头数 * DCP 大小` 均属于 `{8, 12, 64, 96}`，且 "
"latent/RoPE 维度为 512/64。因此，64 头的 GLM 草稿在 TP2/TP4 下使用 FIA。不支持 KV NZ 和 PCP。当目标 "
"KV 缓存为 FP8 时，请在 `--speculative-config` 中为 BF16 草稿设置 `\"kv_cache_dtype\": "
"\"bfloat16\"`。"

msgid "#### Hybrid Gated DeltaNet targets"
msgstr "#### 混合 Gated DeltaNet 目标模型"

msgid ""
"Adaptive GDN verification directly reuses vLLM's Triton recurrent implementation\n"
"with a two-dimensional state table. Its row stride is independent of the current\n"
"query length, so a one-token query can restore the state from an earlier step\n"
"that accepted multiple tokens. The fixed-length path keeps the native recurrent\n"
"operator. This adaptive path requires triton-ascend and is not supported by the\n"
"310P recurrent backend."
msgstr ""
"自适应 GDN 验证直接复用 vLLM 的 Triton 循环实现，并使用二维状态表。其行步长与当前查询长度无关，因此单 token "
"查询可以从先前接受多个 token 的步骤恢复状态。定长路径保留原生循环算子。此自适应路径需要 triton-ascend，310P 循环后端不支持。"

msgid ""
"Ascend declares the device/host query-length mismatch capability and the bounded\n"
"variable-length decode graph capability in its own backend and metadata builder.\n"
"It does not depend on inheriting those declarations from upstream GDN classes.\n"
"The variable-length graph bound is `1 + num_speculative_tokens` with adaptive\n"
"verification enabled; the 310P backend explicitly rejects this capability."
msgstr ""
"昇腾在其自身的后端和元数据构建器中声明设备/主机查询长度不匹配能力以及有界变长解码图能力。它不依赖于从上游 GDN "
"类继承这些声明。启用自适应验证时，变长图的上界为 `1 + num_speculative_tokens`；310P 后端明确拒绝此能力。"

msgid ""
"Use a matching vLLM revision with the strided recurrent API and adaptive-verification\n"
"initialization hooks and the convolution kernel interface used by the paired\n"
"vLLM checkout, together with a DSpark checkpoint\n"
"trained for the target model. For Qwen hybrid targets, including\n"
"Qwen3.8-27B, set `num_speculative_tokens` to the draft checkpoint's supported\n"
"length and enable `enable_adaptive_verification` as above. Keep full decode graphs\n"
"enabled; do not set the target's `enforce_eager=True`. M-RoPE positions continue\n"
"to use vLLM's model-state implementation and the compacted device query boundaries."
msgstr ""
"使用与配套 vLLM 检出所用的步长循环 API、自适应验证初始化钩子和卷积核接口相匹配的 vLLM 版本，以及针对目标模型训练的 DSpark "
"checkpoint。对于 Qwen 混合目标（包括 Qwen3.8-27B），将 `num_speculative_tokens` 设置为 draft"
" checkpoint 支持的长度，并如上所述启用 `enable_adaptive_verification`。保持完整解码图启用；不要设置目标的 "
"`enforce_eager=True`。M-RoPE 位置继续使用 vLLM 的模型状态实现和压缩后的设备查询边界。"

msgid ""
"Validate each target/draft pair on the intended NPU and CANN version. Compare\n"
"plain decoding, fixed-length DSpark, and adaptive DSpark with the same precision,\n"
"TP size, concurrency, prompt/output lengths, and cache settings, after warmup.\n"
"Check output quality and actual admitted draft counts as well as throughput.\n"
"Adaptive GDN uses strided Triton convolution and recurrent updates with device\n"
"query boundaries. This supports FULL-graph padding and a previously accepted\n"
"block followed by a shorter verification query without copying the state cache.\n"
"On A2, fixed verification queries of at least nine tokens also use the strided\n"
"recurrent update as a workaround for native NaNs observed with BF16 and eight\n"
"draft tokens. This threshold records the observed failing configuration, not a\n"
"general hardware limit. A3 and A5 retain their native fixed-verification path;\n"
"adaptive verification uses the strided path independently of this workaround.\n"
"The fixed-path workaround can be removed after the replacement native operator\n"
"stack passes the recurrent numerical and state-update regression tests on A2."
msgstr ""
"在目标 NPU 和 CANN 版本上验证每个目标/draft 对。在预热后，使用相同的精度、TP "
"大小、并发数、提示/输出长度和缓存设置，比较普通解码、定长 DSpark 和自适应 DSpark。除了吞吐量外，还要检查输出质量和实际接受的 draft"
" 数量。自适应 GDN 使用带设备查询边界的步长 Triton 卷积和循环更新。这支持 FULL "
"图填充，以及先前接受的块后跟较短的验证查询，而无需复制状态缓存。在 A2 上，至少九个 token 的固定验证查询也使用步长循环更新，作为在 BF16 "
"和八个 draft token 下观察到的原生 NaN 的变通方案。此阈值记录的是观察到的失败配置，而非通用硬件限制。A3 和 A5 "
"保留其原生固定验证路径；自适应验证独立于此变通方案使用步长路径。在替换的原生算子栈通过 A2 "
"上的循环数值和状态更新回归测试后，可以移除固定路径变通方案。"

msgid ""
"The FIA path copies admitted query boundaries back to the host for partial draft\n"
"budgets. Full and zero budgets already have exact host boundaries and skip that\n"
"synchronization; include the remaining synchronization cost in profiling.\n"
"The upstream recurrent kernel may also have different performance from the native\n"
"operator on each NPU generation; measure the complete target step, rather than\n"
"inferring a speedup from the reduced verification token count alone."
msgstr ""
"对于部分 draft 预算，FIA "
"路径会将接受的查询边界复制回主机。完整预算和零预算已具有精确的主机边界，并跳过该同步；在性能分析中应包含剩余的同步成本。上游循环内核在每个 NPU "
"代际上的性能也可能与原生算子不同；应测量完整的目标步骤，而不是仅从减少的验证 token 数量推断加速。"

msgid ""
"For DSpark on Ascend, DEBUG logs report scheduled and admitted draft counts,\n"
"confidence estimates, and the profiled verification costs. The Ascend runtime\n"
"configuration can reset worker logging to INFO; set\n"
"`runtime_config.ascend_log.modules.vllm.logger` to `DEBUG` in\n"
"`--additional-config` for a diagnostic run. Remove that override for performance\n"
"measurements. If the confidence head produces non-finite estimates, they are\n"
"treated as 1 for budget selection; compare adaptive outputs with fixed and\n"
"non-speculative outputs on NPU before relying on performance results."
msgstr ""
"对于昇腾上的 DSpark，DEBUG 日志会报告调度和接受的 draft 数量、置信度估计以及分析得到的验证成本。昇腾运行时配置可以将 worker "
"日志重置为 INFO；在 `--additional-config` 中将 "
"`runtime_config.ascend_log.modules.vllm.logger` 设置为 `DEBUG` "
"以进行诊断运行。进行性能测量时请移除该覆盖。如果置信度头产生非有限估计，则在预算选择时将其视为 1；在依赖性能结果之前，请在 NPU "
"上比较自适应输出与固定输出和非投机输出。"

msgid ""
"Use a model with MTP support for this example, or retain your existing "
"supported proposer settings. To disable Entropy Verify, set "
"`enable_entropy_verify` to `false` (the default)."
msgstr ""
"此示例请使用支持 MTP 的模型，或保留您现有的受支持 proposer 设置。要禁用 Entropy Verify，请将 "
"`enable_entropy_verify` 设置为 `false`（默认值）。"

msgid ""
"For example, an eight-device Prefill role and an eight-device Decode role can\n"
"use the following layout with `--use-replayssm` and MTP5 on both sides:"
msgstr ""
"例如，一个八设备的 Prefill 角色和一个八设备的 Decode 角色可以在两侧均启用 `--use-replayssm` 和 MTP5 "
"的情况下使用以下布局："

msgid "| Setting | Prefill | Decode |"
msgstr "| 设置 | Prefill | Decode |"

msgid "| Expert parallelism | Enabled (EP8) | Enabled (EP8) |"
msgstr "| 专家并行 | 启用（EP8） | 启用（EP8） |"

msgid "| KV role | `kv_producer` | `kv_consumer` |"
msgstr "| KV 角色 | `kv_producer` | `kv_consumer` |"

msgid "| Target and draft execution | Eager | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` |"
msgstr "| 目标模型与草稿模型执行 | Eager | `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` |"

msgid ""
"In this example, set `--enforce-eager` on Prefill and keep its draft eager as well. Each Decode\n"
"DP rank receives all eight KDA head shards for its assigned requests; DP ranks\n"
"do not divide one request's recurrent state. Keep the same prefix-caching\n"
"configuration on both roles."
msgstr ""
"在此示例中，请在 Prefill 上设置 `--enforce-eager`，并让其草稿模型也保持 eager 模式。每个 Decode\n"
"DP rank 会为其分配的请求接收全部八个 KDA head shard；DP rank\n"
"不会拆分单个请求的循环状态。两个角色需保持相同的前缀缓存\n"
"配置。"

msgid ""
"PCP does not require `--enforce-eager` for the entire P model. Its KDA path has\n"
"an eager dispatch boundary, allowing the surrounding model to be compiled.\n"
"Validate the selected P graph configuration separately for your deployment."
msgstr ""
"PCP 不要求整个 P 模型使用 `--enforce-eager`。其 KDA 路径具有\n"
"eager 调度边界，允许对周边模型进行编译。\n"
"请针对您的部署单独验证所选的 P 图配置。"

msgid ""
"1. **Proposer** (`vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/`): Generates draft (speculative) tokens using various methods — from simple n-gram matching to neural-network-based draft models.\n"
"2. **Rejection Sampler** (`vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/`): Verifies draft tokens against the target model's output, accepting matches and rejecting mismatches, with optional block verification configured through `speculative_config.rejection_sample_method`."
msgstr ""
"1. **提议器（Proposer）**（`vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/`）：使用多种方法生成草稿（投机）token——从简单的 n-gram 匹配到基于神经网络的草稿模型。\n"
"2. **拒绝采样器（Rejection Sampler）**（`vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/`）：将草稿 token 与目标模型的输出进行校验，接受匹配项并拒绝不匹配项，可通过 `speculative_config.rejection_sample_method` 配置可选的块校验。"

msgid ""
"- **`method`** (str, required): The speculative decoding method. Must be one of the supported method names listed in the table above.\n"
"- **`num_speculative_tokens`** (int, required): Number of speculative tokens to generate per forward pass. Auto-filled from the draft model's `n_predict` config (e.g., MTP) when available.\n"
"    > **Note**: For PD Separation deployment, `num_speculative_tokens` should be subject to one of the following conditions:\n"
"    >\n"
"    > 1. Hybrid Mamba models (e.g., Qwen-Next and Qwen3.5 series): `num_speculative_tokens` should be equal on P nodes and D nodes.\n"
"    > 2. Other models: `num_speculative_tokens` on P nodes should be 1, and `num_speculative_tokens` on D nodes should be greater or equal to 1.\n"
"- **`model`** (str, optional): Path or HF repo ID for the draft model. Required for `eagle`, `eagle3`, `dflash`, `medusa`, and `draft_model`. Automatically resolved for `mtp` (reuses target model), `ngram`, and `extract_hidden_states`.\n"
"- **`draft_tensor_parallel_size`** (int, optional): Tensor parallelism size for the draft model. Can only be `1` or the same as the target model's tensor parallel size.\n"
"- **`disable_padded_drafter_batch`** (bool, default: `False`): Disable input padding for speculative decoding. If set to `True`, speculative input batches can contain sequences of different lengths, which may only be supported by certain attention backends. **Note:** Only effective with `eagle`, `eagle3`, `mtp`, `dflash`, `draft_model`, and `extract_hidden_states` methods."
msgstr ""
"- **`method`**（str，必填）：投机解码方法。必须是上表中所列支持的方法名称之一。\n"
"- **`num_speculative_tokens`**（int，必填）：每次前向传播生成的投机 token 数量。当可用时，会从草稿模型的 `n_predict` 配置（例如 MTP）自动填充。\n"
"    > **注意**：对于 PD 分离部署，`num_speculative_tokens` 应满足以下条件之一：\n"
"    >\n"
"    > 1. 混合 Mamba 模型（例如 Qwen-Next 和 Qwen3.5 系列）：P 节点和 D 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应相等。\n"
"    > 2. 其他模型：P 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应为 1，D 节点上的 `num_speculative_tokens` 应大于或等于 1。\n"
"- **`model`**（str，可选）：草稿模型的路径或 HF 仓库 ID。对于 `eagle`、`eagle3`、`dflash`、`medusa` 和 `draft_model` 为必填项。对于 `mtp`（复用目标模型）、`ngram` 和 `extract_hidden_states` 会自动解析。\n"
"- **`draft_tensor_parallel_size`**（int，可选）：草稿模型的张量并行大小。只能为 `1` 或与目标模型的张量并行大小相同。\n"
"- **`disable_padded_drafter_batch`**（bool，默认值：`False`）：禁用投机解码的输入填充。如果设置为 `True`，投机输入批次可以包含不同长度的序列，这可能仅受某些注意力后端支持。**注意：** 仅对 `eagle`、`eagle3`、`mtp`、`dflash`、`draft_model` 和 `extract_hidden_states` 方法有效。"

msgid ""
"1. The draft model runs the block in one forward pass. Its decoder layers\n"
"   wrap the attention and MLP sublayers with learned block-causal grouped\n"
"   convolutions that mix information across the K+1 query positions.\n"
"2. The draft's hidden states go through the **target model's LM head**\n"
"   (shared, unquantized): the full-vocabulary logits are top-k'd per draft\n"
"   position, giving `selector_top_k` candidate tokens per step.\n"
"3. A **candidate selector** head scores every edge of the candidate lattice:\n"
"   a per-candidate unary logit plus a bilinear term between predecessor and\n"
"   successor token codebooks and the projected hidden state.\n"
"4. A path walk picks the highest-scoring chain of candidates starting from\n"
"   the anchor token — greedily, or with Gumbel-max sampling at the request\n"
"   temperature when probabilistic draft sampling is enabled. The selected\n"
"   path's scores are also scattered back into full-vocabulary draft logits for\n"
"   the rejection sampler."
msgstr ""
"1. 草稿模型在一次前向传播中运行该块。其解码器层使用学习到的块因果分组卷积包裹注意力和 MLP 子层，在 K+1 个查询位置之间混合信息。\n"
"2. 草稿的隐藏状态经过**目标模型的 LM head**（共享、未量化）：全词表 logits 按草稿位置进行 top-k 选择，每一步给出 `selector_top_k` 个候选 token。\n"
"3. **候选选择器**头对候选格中每条边进行打分：每个候选的一元 logit，加上前驱和后继 token 码本与投影隐藏状态之间的双线性项。\n"
"4. 路径游走从锚点 token 开始，选择得分最高的候选链——贪婪地选择，或在启用概率性草稿采样时按请求温度使用 Gumbel-max 采样。所选路径的分数也会被散射回全词表草稿 logits，供拒绝采样器使用。"

msgid ""
"1. **Draft sampling**: DFlash2 drafts greedily by default. Set\n"
"   `\"draft_sample_method\": \"probabilistic\"` to sample the draft path at the\n"
"   request temperature. LM-head TP does not support probabilistic draft\n"
"   sampling:"
msgstr ""
"1. **草稿采样**：DFlash2 默认以贪婪方式生成草稿。设置\n"
"   `\"draft_sample_method\": \"probabilistic\"` 可按请求温度对草稿路径进行采样。LM-head TP 不支持概率性草稿\n"
"   采样："

msgid ""
"2. **Draft graphs**: DFlash2 supports full ACL graphs when the\n"
"   target enables `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` or `FULL_AND_PIECEWISE` and the draft's\n"
"   `enforce_eager` is unset or false."
msgstr ""
"2. **草稿图**：当目标模型启用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` 或 `FULL_AND_PIECEWISE`，且草稿的\n"
"   `enforce_eager` 未设置或为 false 时，DFlash2 支持完整的 ACL 图。"

msgid ""
"LiLiCorr requires eager draft execution on Ascend. Set the nested speculative\n"
"`enforce_eager` option to `true`. The target model retains its independently\n"
"configured execution mode."
msgstr ""
"LiLiCorr 在昇腾上要求草稿以 eager 模式执行。将嵌套的投机\n"
"`enforce_eager` 选项设置为 `true`。目标模型保留其独立\n"
"配置的执行模式。"

msgid ""
"On 950DT Products, GLM (`GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM`) targets paired with\n"
"`Qwen3DSparkModel` GQA drafts can use the device-length CANN FlashAttn backend.\n"
"This requires FP16/BF16 queries and unquantized draft KV cache. When all draft\n"
"layers use FlashAttn, the runner can skip the speculative CPU length\n"
"synchronization; PP, PCP, DCP, KV transfer, sparse KV offload, and adaptive\n"
"verification retain their existing synchronization path."
msgstr ""
"在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，与\n"
"`Qwen3DSparkModel` GQA 草稿配对的 GLM（`GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM`）目标模型可以使用设备长度 CANN FlashAttn 后端。\n"
"这要求 FP16/BF16 查询和未量化的草稿 KV 缓存。当所有草稿\n"
"层都使用 FlashAttn 时，运行器可以跳过投机 CPU 长度\n"
"同步；PP、PCP、DCP、KV 传输、稀疏 KV 卸载和自适应\n"
"校验保留其现有的同步路径。"

msgid ""
"GLM also supports DSpark with MLA drafts (`Glm5DSparkForCausalLM`), which can\n"
"use the device-length FlashMLA backend on the same hardware.\n"
"This requires FP16/BF16 queries and unquantized KV cache with matching dtype.\n"
"When the draft selects FlashMLA, the runner can skip speculative CPU length\n"
"synchronization under the same conditions as the GQA path; FIA fallback retains\n"
"exact CPU length synchronization."
msgstr ""
"GLM 还支持使用 MLA 草稿的 DSpark（`Glm5DSparkForCausalLM`），它可以在相同硬件上\n"
"使用设备长度 FlashMLA 后端。\n"
"这要求 FP16/BF16 查询和具有匹配 dtype 的未量化 KV 缓存。\n"
"当草稿选择 FlashMLA 时，运行器可以在与 GQA 路径相同的条件下跳过投机 CPU 长度\n"
"同步；FIA 回退保留\n"
"精确的 CPU 长度同步。"

msgid ""
"When `enable_adaptive_verification` is enabled, vLLM Ascend does not support fully eager execution or pure `PIECEWISE` graph mode for the target model. The same restriction applies in vLLM.\n"
"    In vLLM Ascend, adaptive verification cannot be combined with PP, PCP, DCP, LM head TP, or LoRA.\n"
"    Commercial use is restricted."
msgstr ""
"当启用 `enable_adaptive_verification` 时，vLLM Ascend 不支持目标模型的完全 eager 执行或纯 `PIECEWISE` 图模式。vLLM 中也有相同的限制。\n"
"    在 vLLM Ascend 中，自适应校验不能与 PP、PCP、DCP、LM head TP 或 LoRA 组合使用。\n"
"    商业使用受限。"

msgid ""
"The GDN path supports variable verification lengths, including\n"
"steps that admit no draft tokens. Zero-draft decode requests retain the previous\n"
"step's accepted-token offset so convolution and recurrent attention resume from\n"
"the correct state. ACL Graph capture uses the same speculative path for one-token\n"
"rows, and padding requests have zero-length GDN queries."
msgstr ""
"GDN 路径支持可变的校验长度，包括\n"
"不接受任何草稿 token 的步骤。零草稿解码请求保留上一步\n"
"的已接受 token 偏移量，以便卷积和循环注意力从\n"
"正确的状态恢复。ACL Graph 捕获对单 token 行使用相同的投机路径，\n"
"填充请求具有零长度的 GDN 查询。"

msgid ""
"Ascend reuses vLLM's confidence estimates, cost profiling, budget allocator, and\n"
"rejection sampler. Newer vLLM Triton budget allocators are used directly;\n"
"legacy torch budget allocators run eagerly on Ascend.\n"
"No change to sampling probabilities or model weights is required."
msgstr ""
"昇腾复用 vLLM 的置信度估计、成本分析、预算分配器和\n"
"拒绝采样器。较新的 vLLM Triton 预算分配器直接使用；\n"
"旧版 torch 预算分配器在昇腾上以 eager 模式运行。\n"
"无需更改采样概率或模型权重。"

msgid ""
"Dynamic Speculative Decoding adapts the number of draft tokens (K) at "
"runtime, instead of always using a fixed `num_speculative_tokens`. This "
"helps keep speculative decoding beneficial as concurrency changes. vLLM "
"Ascend provides one approach:"
msgstr ""
"动态投机解码在运行时自适应调整草稿 token 数量（K），而不是始终使用固定的 "
"`num_speculative_tokens`。这有助于在并发变化时保持投机解码的收益。vLLM Ascend 提供了一种方法："

msgid ""
"- **Batch-size based (Autoregressive)**: select a shared K from concurrency "
"ranges via `num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size`."
msgstr ""
"- **基于批大小（自回归）**：通过 `num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size` 从并发范围中选择共享的 K。"

msgid ""
"- Variable concurrency on the same deployment: K decreases as concurrency increases.\n"
"- RL rollout workloads that start with high BS and later shrink to a few long-tail requests: K can increase again toward the end of the rollout.\n"
"- Currently supports MTP, EAGLE-3, DFlash, n-gram, and similar methods. DSpark and `MTP + DCP + DSD` are currently not supported on this path."
msgstr ""
"- 同一部署下的可变并发：K 随并发增加而减小。\n"
"- RL rollout 工作负载以高 BS 启动，随后缩减为少量长尾请求：K 可能在 rollout 接近结束时再次增大。\n"
"- 目前支持 MTP、EAGLE-3、DFlash、n-gram 及类似方法。此路径目前不支持 DSpark 和 `MTP + DCP + DSD`。"

msgid "## Block Verification"
msgstr "## 块验证"

msgid ""
"Block verification jointly verifies a block of draft tokens using cumulative"
" target-to-draft probability ratios and samples a recovery token from the "
"corresponding residual distribution. This can increase the accepted draft "
"length while preserving the target sampling distribution. Performance gains "
"depend on the draft model and workload."
msgstr ""
"块验证使用累积的目标与草稿概率比来联合验证一个草稿 token 块，并从相应的残差分布中采样一个恢复 "
"token。这可以在保持目标采样分布的同时增加被接受的草稿长度。性能收益取决于草稿模型和工作负载。"

msgid ""
"To enable block verification, set `\"rejection_sample_method\": \"block\"` "
"in `speculative_config`, alongside your existing proposer settings. The "
"default remains `\"standard\"`; omit this field or set it to `\"standard\"` "
"to disable block verification."
msgstr ""
"要启用块验证，请在 `speculative_config` 中设置 `\"rejection_sample_method\": "
"\"block\"`，并保留现有的 proposer 设置。默认值仍为 `\"standard\"`；省略此字段或将其设置为 "
"`\"standard\"` 即可禁用块验证。"

msgid "## Entropy Verify {: #entropy-verify }"
msgstr "## 熵验证 {: #entropy-verify }"

msgid ""
"vLLM Ascend provides an optional optimization for the rejection sampler in "
"speculative decoding: **Entropy Verify**. It trades a small amount of output"
" precision for improved inference throughput."
msgstr "vLLM Ascend 为投机解码中的拒绝采样器提供了一项可选优化：**熵验证**。它以少量输出精度换取推理吞吐的提升。"

msgid ""
"Entropy Verify modifies the token acceptance criteria and may cause minor "
"precision degradation (e.g., slightly different output tokens compared to "
"the standard rejection sampler). Evaluate the quality impact on your "
"specific workload before enabling them in production."
msgstr ""
"熵验证会修改 token 接受标准，可能导致轻微的精度下降（例如，与标准拒绝采样器相比输出 token "
"略有不同）。在生产环境启用前，请评估其对您特定工作负载的质量影响。"

msgid ""
"Enable Entropy Verify with "
"`additional_config.rejection_sampler_config.enable_entropy_verify=true`."
msgstr ""
"通过 `additional_config.rejection_sampler_config.enable_entropy_verify=true` "
"启用熵验证。"

msgid ""
"Entropy is computed from the target logits after sampling parameters (such "
"as temperature, top-k/top-p and penalties) are applied, for both raw and "
"processed logprobs modes. Each draft position uses its own threshold "
"`min(exp(-entropy * posterior_alpha), posterior_threshold)`. Greedy requests"
" retain their existing behavior, and synthetic rejection sampling uses its "
"configured acceptance rates. Use Entropy Verify with "
"`rejection_sample_method=\"standard\"`; upstream `\"block\"` verification "
"and Entropy Verify are mutually exclusive."
msgstr ""
"在应用采样参数（如 temperature、top-k/top-p 和惩罚项）之后，从目标 logits 计算熵，适用于原始和处理后的 logprobs"
" 模式。每个草稿位置使用各自的阈值 `min(exp(-entropy * posterior_alpha), "
"posterior_threshold)`。贪心请求保持其现有行为，合成拒绝采样使用其配置的接受率。熵验证需与 "
"`rejection_sample_method=\"standard\"` 配合使用；上游的 `\"block\"` 验证与熵验证互斥。"

msgid "Keep your proposer configuration and add:"
msgstr "保留您的 proposer 配置并添加："

msgid ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash supports experimental KDA RecoverSSM on A3 and A5. It reconstructs\n"
"the accepted recurrent state after speculative decoding instead of keeping a\n"
"recurrent checkpoint for every draft token.\n"
"The default remains the native AscendC KDA path."
msgstr ""
"GLM-5.3-Flash 在 A3 和 A5 上支持实验性的 KDA RecoverSSM。它在投机解码后重建被接受的循环状态，而不是为每个草稿 token 保留循环检查点。\n"
"默认仍使用原生 AscendC KDA 路径。"

msgid ""
"RecoverSSM requires speculative decoding, PP=1 and DCP=1. PCP is limited to\n"
"Prefill producers with TP=1;\n"
"PCP Decode consumers and colocated PCP execution are not supported.\n"
"Stochastic rounding must be disabled."
msgstr ""
"RecoverSSM 需要投机解码、PP=1 和 DCP=1。PCP 仅限于 TP=1 的 Prefill 生产者；\n"
"不支持 PCP Decode 消费者和同址 PCP 执行。\n"
"必须禁用随机舍入。"

msgid ""
"For direct prefill-to-decode transfer, use `MooncakeConnectorV2` or\n"
"`MooncakePullConnector` with matching model weights, speculative window,\n"
"cache dtypes, convolution layout and RecoverSSM settings on both sides.\n"
"PCP producers may use a different KDA head-shard count from Decode consumers:\n"
"Mooncake gathers the producer head shards into each receiving consumer's state.\n"
"Use SD convolution state layout `[state_len, conv_dim]` on both roles when\n"
"their KDA head-shard counts differ."
msgstr ""
"对于直接的 prefill 到 decode 传输，请使用 `MooncakeConnectorV2` 或\n"
"`MooncakePullConnector`，并确保两侧的模型权重、投机窗口、\n"
"缓存 dtype、卷积布局和 RecoverSSM 设置一致。\n"
"PCP 生产者可以使用与 Decode 消费者不同的 KDA head 分片数：\n"
"Mooncake 会将生产者的 head 分片收集到每个接收消费者的状态中。\n"
"当两侧的 KDA head 分片数不同时，请在两种角色上使用 SD 卷积状态布局 `[state_len, conv_dim]`。"

msgid ""
"For external prefix-cache storage and recovery with RecoverSSM, use\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector` with the Memcache or Mooncake backend. When combining\n"
"external prefix caching with direct prefill-to-decode transfer, use\n"
"`MultiConnector` to combine the Store connector with the transfer connector.\n"
"Follow the cache-layout and parallelism requirements in the\n"
"[AscendStore deployment guide](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) and, for Mooncake\n"
"layerwise hybrid pooling, the\n"
"[hybrid attention guide](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md)."
msgstr ""
"对于使用 RecoverSSM 的外部前缀缓存存储与恢复，请使用\n"
"`AscendStoreConnector` 并搭配 Memcache 或 Mooncake 后端。当将\n"
"外部前缀缓存与直接的 prefill 到 decode 传输结合使用时，请使用\n"
"`MultiConnector` 将 Store 连接器与传输连接器组合起来。\n"
"请遵循\n"
"[AscendStore 部署指南](kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 中的缓存布局和并行度要求，对于 Mooncake\n"
"逐层混合池化，请参阅\n"
"[混合注意力指南](mooncake_hybrid_attention.md)。"

msgid ""
"Upstream vLLM's synthetic path draws the per-token uniform numbers with "
"`tl_rand64` (fp64) directly inside the Triton kernel. NPU Triton does "
"**not** support `tl_rand64`/fp64, so vLLM Ascend reimplements synthetic mode"
" in `vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/rejection_sampler_utils.py`: the "
"uniform draw is generated **inside** `_probabilistic_rejection_kernel` with "
"`SYNTHETIC_MODE=True`, using a 1-element-block fp32 `tl.rand` clamped to "
"`[2^-31, 1)` — equivalent to upstream's `includes_zero=False` semantics. "
"Both greedy and sampling temperatures are supported, and the first rejected "
"position is followed by a resampled/bonus token from the target "
"distribution, as in `standard` mode."
msgstr ""
"上游 vLLM 的合成路径直接在 Triton kernel 内使用 `tl_rand64`（fp64）生成每个 token 的均匀随机数。NPU "
"Triton **不**支持 `tl_rand64`/fp64，因此 vLLM Ascend 在 "
"`vllm_ascend/worker/v2/spec_decode/rejection_sampler_utils.py` "
"中重新实现了合成模式：均匀随机数在 `_probabilistic_rejection_kernel` **内部**以 "
"`SYNTHETIC_MODE=True` 生成，使用 1 元素块的 fp32 `tl.rand` 并钳制到 `[2^-31, 1)` —— "
"等价于上游的 `includes_zero=False` 语义。同时支持贪心和采样温度，并且在第一个被拒绝的位置之后，会从目标分布中重新采样/附加一个 "
"bonus token，与 `standard` 模式相同。"

msgid ""
"The configuration interface (`rejection_sample_method`, "
"`synthetic_acceptance_rates`, `synthetic_acceptance_length`) is shared with "
"`standard` mode."
msgstr ""
"配置接口（`rejection_sample_method`、`synthetic_acceptance_rates`、`synthetic_acceptance_length`）与"
" `standard` 模式共用。"
